  "steps": [
    "Boil the noodles in salted water until just cooked, drain, rinse with cold water and toss with 1 tsp of the oil.",
    "Heat the remaining oil in a wok on the highest flame and add the garlic and spring onion whites.",
    "Add the carrot, cabbage and capsicum and stir-fry for 2 minutes so they stay crisp.",
    "Add the soy sauce, chilli sauce, vinegar, pepper and salt.",
    "Add the noodles and toss quickly for 2 minutes until evenly coated.",
    "Finish with the spring onion greens and serve immediately."
  ]
